"Crash-free processes and functioning in-memory stores/FSMs\",\n          \"Validated heterogeneous election/lease timeouts\",\n          \"Delivery-only transport partition; optional pipelining unsupported\",\n          \"No further configuration or restore operation after prefix\"\n        ],\n        \"excluded\": [\n          \"Eventual response under arbitrary scheduling\",\n          \"Application read linearizability or conflicting committed logs\",\n          \"Generic pipeline correctness and stable storage crash faults\"\n        ],\n        \"parameters\": {}\n      },\n      \"rationale\": \"Use the accepted question and align its first discriminator to public VerifyLeader completion after same-history higher-term majority progress. The obligation is derived from the API contract independently of exploration outcome.\",\n      \"status\": \"partial\",\n      \"previous_id\": null,\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"boundary_changes\": [],\n      \"obligation_checks\": {\n        \"O-verify-after-majority\": [\n          \"f3ad8013413542dd8759d95a1e2347b5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"remaining_obligation_ids\": [\n        \"O-verify-after-majority\"\n      ],\n      \"recheck_reasons\": [],\n      \"semantic_readiness\": {},\n      \"coverage_limitations\": [\n        \"Bounded direct comparison completed; local attribution remains pending: Direct oracle correspondence is unreviewed\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\nrg: ../direct-checks/af1bb814fce843fa8230004036da7120: IO error for operation on ../direct-checks/af1bb814fce843fa8230004036da7120: No such file or directory (os error 2)\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
